  <p id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-chun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-chun:p001:m0000" ref="u63_dpj_nji">淳</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-chun:p001:m0003" ref="u63_dpj_nji">孝沖</persName>。亦有文藻，與<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-chun:p001:m0012" ref="r5i_988_cxa">湛</persName>俱知名。官至弋陽太守。遭中原傾覆，子侄多沒胡寇，唯息<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-chun:p001:m0039" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">承</persName>渡江。</p>
</text>
